  "body": "A [source set](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#source-set) is a set of image sources and a source size. The [parse a srcset attribute](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#parse-a-srcset-attribute) algorithm starts with \"an initially empty source set\", but never assigns a value to the source size; instead, this comes from [update the source set](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#update-the-source-set) which derives it in step 4.1.2 (after parsing srcset in 4.1.1). It would be more clear for the srcset parsing algorithm to return a set of zero or more image sources.",
